# Problem Solving with TypeScript & OOP

This repository contains my solutions for the TypeScript and OOP assignment.

## File Structure

```text
├── solutions.ts
├── type-vs-interface.md
├── type-narrowing.md
└── README.md
Description
solutions.ts: Contains the solutions to all 8 coding problems covering basic types, type narrowing, tuples, generics, interfaces, classes with access modifiers, and promises.

type-vs-interface.md: A blog post explaining the differences between type aliases and interfaces.

type-narrowing.md: A blog post explaining type narrowing using typeof and the in operator.

How to Run
Clone the repository to your computer.

Open the project folder in VS Code.

Run the TypeScript compiler in watch mode:

Bash
tsc --watch